&lt;li&gt;Travel occasionally to customer sites for workshops, implementation support, and building relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend conferences, lead speaking engagements, and write blog posts and white papers on topics surrounding the AI space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
